From 0ed27aa49ba1a627cda0fc6737c53591f5c62bc9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elkir0 <elkir0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/16] misc: modem_v1: import the Samsung 3.10 SS333 sources
 verbatim (not built)

Verbatim copy, from kernel_universal5433 (GPLv2, LineageOS
android_kernel_samsung_universal5433), of the drivers/misc/modem_v1 files
the SS333/MIPI-LLI/SPI configuration of lineage_gts28ltexx_defconfig
builds (lines 1322-1348), minus the link-PM FSM (link_device_pm.c,
modem_pm.h), IOSM, C2C, SHMEM, HSIC, SS300 and XMM7260 code and
boot_device_spi.c.  include/linux/platform_data/modem_v1.h and
modem_debug.h move under drivers/misc/modem_v1/include/.

No Kconfig or Makefile hook: this commit only gives the next commits a
base, so that 'git diff' of the port shows exactly the 3.10 -> 6.12
changes (research/modem/research/analysis/kernel_port_design.md
section 1.2, SYNTHESIS.md D1).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
